{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Ds8Y4FwHFCetz91HUNm4Ti","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n1. I need to implement story US-216 from prd.json\n2. The story is about \"Malaysia Online Safety Act 2025 – Add safety reporting mechanism for user-submitted content\"\n3. I should follow the Ralph Autonomous Agent protocol\n4. This is a SPIRAL orchestrator task - focus on this ONE story only\n\nLet me start by reading the relevant files:\n1. prd.json to get the full story details\n2. progress.txt to understand the codebase patterns\n3. Then create a plan before implementing\n\nThe flow should be:\n- Phase 1 (PLAN): Read story JSON and progress.txt, produce implementation plan\n- Phase 2 (EXECUTE): Follow the plan, read files, make changes, run tests\n\nLet me start.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21442,"cache_read_input_tokens":40649,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":21442},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115e48ae-ae40-4acb-bf1e-0da935409628","uuid":"ef142888-bacf-4dfb-b017-13c4f951ee04"}
