{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_016mRFKq3fUAabBWupAeAm6R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! So there's an English Terms page at `/terms/page.tsx`. Let me now create my implementation plan based on what I've learned.\n\n## DIAGNOSIS & PLAN\n\n### Current State\n- The pelangi-website project has a Reviews component displaying hosted guest reviews on the home page\n- A Testimonials component exists with references to external platforms\n- There's a Terms page at `/terms/page.tsx`  \n- No safety reporting mechanism currently exists\n- No Content Safety Guidelines page exists\n\n### Problem Identified\nMalaysia's Online Safety Act 2025 (Act 866, effective Jan 1, 2026) requires:\n1. A \"Report Content\" mechanism for any hosted UGC (they have Reviews displayed)\n2. A Content Safety/Community Guidelines page\n3. A designated contact for safety reports\n4. Terms of Service clarification about scope\n5. Legal review documentation\n\n### Planned Changes\n1. Create `site/src/components/ReportContentButton.tsx` - Reusable report button with aria-label and icon\n2. Create `site/src/app/safety-guidelines/page.tsx` - New page with content policy and reporting info\n3. Update `site/src/components/Reviews.tsx` - Add Report button adjacent to each review\n4. Update Terms pages - Add section acknowledging Online Safety Act compliance\n\nLet me proceed with the implementation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_read_input_tokens":75079,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115e48ae-ae40-4acb-bf1e-0da935409628","uuid":"74c77cff-01bd-4882-ac15-6ba20e45dcb0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_016mRFKq3fUAabBWupAeAm6R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current State\nThe pelangi-website has:\n- A Reviews component displaying hosted guest reviews on the home page\n- A Testimonials component referencing external platforms (Google Reviews, Hostelworld, Booking.com)\n- Terms pages (English and Malay)\n- No safety reporting mechanism or Content Safety Guidelines page\n\n## Problem Identified\nMalaysia's Online Safety Act 2025 (Act 866, effective Jan 1, 2026) requires:\n1. A \"Report Content\" button adjacent to each piece of hosted UGC\n2. A published Content Safety/Community Guidelines page\n3. A designated contact for safety reports (accessible within 2 clicks)\n4. Terms of Service clarification on platform scope\n5. Legal review documentation\n\n## Planned Changes\n1. Create `ReportContentButton.tsx` component with report functionality\n2. Create `site/src/app/safety-guidelines/page.tsx` - Content Safety & Community Guidelines page  \n3. Update `site/src/components/Reviews.tsx` - Add Report button to each review\n4. Update `site/src/app/terms/page.tsx` - Add Online Safety Act compliance section\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [\"site/src/components/ReportContentButton.tsx\", \"site/src/app/safety-guidelines/page.tsx\"],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/components/Reviews.tsx\", \"site/src/app/terms/page.tsx\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [\"ReportContentButton\"],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 180\n}\n</plan>\n\nNow implementing:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":167,"cache_read_input_tokens":75079,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":167},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115e48ae-ae40-4acb-bf1e-0da935409628","uuid":"8655b270-9f0b-40e4-9458-e6508ffbf7d6"}
