{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LD6Qm1VaAsFpRVEtUFh55w","type":"tool_result","content":"415\t\n416\t              {/* 11. Changes */}\n417\t              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n418\t                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n419\t                  11. Changes to These Terms\n420\t                </h2>\n421\t                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed\">\n422\t                  We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Changes\n423\t                  will be posted on this page with an updated &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo;\n424\t                  date. Continued use of this website after changes constitutes acceptance\n425\t                  of the revised Terms.\n426\t                </p>\n427\t              </section>\n428\t\n429\t              {/* 12. Contact */}\n430\t              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n431\t                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n432\t                  12. Contact Us\n433\t                </h2>\n434\t                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n435\t                  If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us:\n436\t                </p>\n437\t                <div className=\"bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-lg p-5 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300\">\n438\t                  <p className=\"font-medium\">Pelangi Capsule Hostel</p>\n439\t                  <p>26A Jalan Perang, Taman Pelangi</p>\n440\t                  <p>80400 Johor Bahru, Johor, Malaysia</p>\n441\t                  <p className=\"mt-2\">\n442\t                    Email:{\" \"}\n443\t                    <a\n444\t                      href=\"mailto:pelangicapsule@gmail.com\"\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115e48ae-ae40-4acb-bf1e-0da935409628","uuid":"55823cb1-d54b-4819-b58e-d71152a58481","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:38:33.156Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\Software Projects\\pelangi-website\\site\\src\\app\\terms\\page.tsx","content":"\n              {/* 11. Changes */}\n              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n                  11. Changes to These Terms\n                </h2>\n                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                  We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Changes\n                  will be posted on this page with an updated &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo;\n                  date. Continued use of this website after changes constitutes acceptance\n                  of the revised Terms.\n                </p>\n              </section>\n\n              {/* 12. Contact */}\n              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n                  12. Contact Us\n                </h2>\n                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n                  If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us:\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-lg p-5 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300\">\n                  <p className=\"font-medium\">Pelangi Capsule Hostel</p>\n                  <p>26A Jalan Perang, Taman Pelangi</p>\