{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015Dvj2dbqBVzwnGCwhHPYtp","type":"tool_result","content":"460\t                  tarikh &ldquo;Kemaskini terakhir&rdquo; yang dikemaskini.\n461\t                  Penggunaan berterusan laman web ini selepas perubahan dibuat\n462\t                  bermaksud penerimaan Terma yang disemak semula.\n463\t                </p>\n464\t              </section>\n465\t\n466\t              {/* 12. Hubungi Kami */}\n467\t              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n468\t                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n469\t                  12. Hubungi Kami\n470\t                </h2>\n471\t                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n472\t                  Jika anda mempunyai soalan mengenai Terma ini, sila hubungi\n473\t                  kami:\n474\t                </p>\n475\t                <div className=\"bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-800 rounded-lg p-5 text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300\">\n476\t                  <p className=\"font-medium\">Pelangi Capsule Hostel</p>\n477\t                  <p>26A Jalan Perang, Taman Pelangi</p>\n478\t                  <p>80400 Johor Bahru, Johor, Malaysia</p>\n479\t                  <p className=\"mt-2\">\n480\t                    E-mel:{\" \"}\n481\t                    <a\n482\t                      href=\"mailto:pelangicapsule@gmail.com\"\n483\t                      className=\"text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 underline hover:text-amber-800 dark:hover:text-amber-300\"\n484\t                    >\n485\t                      pelangicapsule@gmail.com\n486\t                    </a>\n487\t                  </p>\n488\t                  <p>\n489\t                    WhatsApp:{\" \"}\n490\t                    <a\n491\t                      href=\"https://wa.me/60127088789\"\n492\t                      className=\"text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 underline hover:tex