{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J3Jmu4QrTX7qLvNNMKYPvd","type":"tool_result","content":"440\t              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n441\t                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n442\t                  10. Undang-Undang yang Terpakai\n443\t                </h2>\n444\t                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed\">\n445\t                  Terma ini ditadbir oleh dan ditafsirkan mengikut undang-undang\n446\t                  Malaysia. Sebarang pertikaian yang timbul daripada Terma ini\n447\t                  atau penggunaan perkhidmatan kami akan tertakluk kepada bidang\n448\t                  kuasa eksklusif mahkamah Johor Bahru, Johor, Malaysia.\n449\t                </p>\n450\t              </section>\n451\t\n452\t              {/* 11. Perubahan */}\n453\t              <section className=\"mb-8\">\n454\t                <h2 className=\"font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 mb-4\">\n455\t                  11. Perubahan kepada Terma Ini\n456\t                </h2>\n457\t                <p className=\"text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 leading-relaxed\">\n458\t                  Kami berhak untuk mengemaskini atau mengubah Terma ini pada\n459\t                  bila-bila masa. Perubahan akan disiarkan di halaman ini dengan\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115e48ae-ae40-4acb-bf1e-0da935409628","uuid":"1645cc80-acb7-46ac-a4b5-6f0ce43a4d71","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:39:14.980Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\User